## h i g h l i g h t s
Fe-MOF/Au-8/FF nanorods were successfully prepared by hydrothermal method and Au electrodeposition.   
Electrodeposition of Au on Fe-MOF/FF nanorods can not only improve conductivity, but also adjust electronic structure.   
Electrodeposition of Au on Fe-MOF/FF nanorods increased active specific surface area and exposed more active sites.   
Fe-MOF/Au-8/FF nanorods have outstanding bifunctional electrocatalytic properties of OER and HER.
g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
Fe-MOF/Au-8/FF nanorods with extraordinary bifunctional electrocatalytic properties of OER and HER were fabricated by hydrothermal strategy and Au electrodeposition.
